    "Set_CHF_On_MRA": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "chf_on_mra",
      "value": true,
      "direct_transition": "Empagliflozin",
      "remarks": [
        "Fix round 1 (2026-08-10): 'Other Step 3' used to gate on",
        "'condition_type: PriorState, name: MRA' to check whether MRA was",
        "started on an earlier visit. That can never work: this submodule is",
        "invoked fresh via CallSubmodule on every congestive follow-up visit,",
        "and CallSubmodule.process clears the submodule's own history",
        "(person.attributes.remove(submoduleName), State.java ~336) once a",
        "call completes, so a later visit's PriorState check can never see",
        "an earlier visit's MRA order -- the BiDil/IVA/Dig step-3 arm behind",
        "it was structurally unreachable, before and after the Task 1.7 typo",
        "fix. A persistent person attribute (unlike module history,",
        "person.attributes is never cleared between calls) makes the same",
        "intent -- 'step-3 escalation only after MRA is established' --",
        "actually work across visits."
      ]
    },
