        "high": 365,
        "unit": "days"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Visit_Encounter_End": {
      "type": "EncounterEnd",
      "remarks": [
        "Task 1.7: added so every visit closes CHF_Medication_Encounter",
        "(opened by the calling chf_meds.json, inherited into this",
        "submodule) before the annual maintenance delay elapses. This",
        "submodule has no Encounter state of its own -- it runs inside",
        "whatever encounter chf_meds.json's own CHF_Medication_Encounter",
        "opened; EncounterEnd closes whatever is currently open",
        "regardless of which module opened it. Every *_Supply_Delay in",
        "this file was likewise deleted (its only purpose was to hold",
        "open a 30-day window before a MedicationEnd that is itself",
        "deleted -- chronic:true GDMT is renewed annually by the engine,",
        "State.java ~963) so orders now fire back-to-back in one visit."
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Terminal_Delay"
    }
